You don't have to pass on my offer like that...

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:34.670
I wonder who Hikaru is waiting for...

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.840
Hikaru! Were you waiting long?

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:43.980
What the...?! Kasuga?!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.550
Just as I feared!

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:08.440
"Some man must've
gotten her all stimulated!"

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.480
"What?! Stimulated?!
What kind of stimulation?!"

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:15.010
"Between a man and a woman... There's only U-KNOW-WHAT!"

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.870
So, that's what happened!

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:28.550
That bastard!

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:40.840
Tears shouldn't be held back, you know.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:46.840
It's not you to cry like a baby, you know.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:53.590
If you wanna vent your anger on someone...

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:59.380
...ride on the beat... and say good-bye.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:06.100
You're not the only one, Lonely Midnight Girl.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.030
We'll sing to blow away the sadness...

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:11.260
"Between a man and a woman... There's only U-KNOW-WHAT!"
We'll sing to blow away the sadness...

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:18.240
As Hikaru's energy... and the energy of the music merged...

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.440
I... I...

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:29.170
I had no idea what Yuusaku was up to at that moment.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:48.080
It'll make a difference if you make a noise on the floor...

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:52.630
It's useless crying like a baby, you know.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.340
Hikaru...

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.210
If you wanna be treated like a baby by someone...
Hikaru...

00:18:55.210 --> 00:19:00.510
If you wanna be treated like a baby by someone...

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:04.890
Before you act so special..."Knock On!"

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:06.650
Hikaru...
Before you act so special..."Knock On!"

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:06.730
Before you act so special..."Knock On!"

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:12.940
You're not the only one... Lonely Midnight Girl.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:18.460
We'll sing to blow away the sadness...

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:24.500
Breakin' Heart... Hold Me!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.110
Breakin' Heart...

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:26.770
But, after that...
Breakin' Heart...

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.680
Kiss me, 'til the morning comes.
But, after that...

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:28.810
Kiss me, 'til the morning comes.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.520
...just as I was feeling like I was acting like a grown-up...
Kiss me, 'til the morning comes.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.070
...just as I was feeling like I was acting like a grown-up...

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:38.240
...I did something that was unbelievably awful.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:46.190
I'm so thirsty! Wanna get
something to drink, Ayukawa?

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.580
I... I'm sorry!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:59.950
I... I've seen Ayukawa wearing something just like it, so...

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.270
...so that's why I...

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.220
Hikaru!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:11.090
H...Hikaru!

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:34.310
How hopeless... I am.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.380
Kasuga!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.620
I gotta get outta here!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:53.600
Why you!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.640
Sempai!

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.490
Yuusaku, you brat!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.110
What's with this, all of a sudden?!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.620
How dare you... when you're still in Jr. High!

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.220
You'd better be accepting responsibility for this!

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:09.020
Huh?

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:10.890
You'd better be getting married!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:12.960
You'd better be able to feed them!

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.560
Wh... What are you talking about?!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:18.130
You'd better have the confidence to make Hikaru happy!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:18.820
Huh?!

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:22.020
If you can't give me an acceptable answer,
then this is what you get!

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:22.830
Don't run away!

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:23.790
Yuusaku, what're you doing?!
Don't run away!

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.530
Yuusaku, what're you doing?!

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:27.170
Hikaru!

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.740
Huh?

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.800
Hikaru, you stay out of this!

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:33.300
Don't you dare lay your hands on my Darling!

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:35.370
H...Hikaru...

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:42.560
The fact that you're in this condition... is all his fault, isn't it?!

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:45.390
Well... it's kinda true, but then...

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:48.450
Just as I thought...

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:50.590
You bastard!

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:51.380
Yuusaku!
You bastard!

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:51.850
Say...
Yuusaku!

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.760
Say...

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:56.830
...what are you guys doing?

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:02.870
You mean, you did it all?!

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:03.520
Yup.
You mean, you did it all?!

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:03.600
You mean, you did it all?!

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.270
Hikaru was desperate to look a bit like a grown-up, so...

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.460
Oh, c'mon, you don't have to say it!

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:12.420
Apparently, she was putting lots of effort into it.

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:14.980
You caused quite a stir, Hikaru!

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:17.140
I didn't know that it was about that kinda thing.

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.550
Some people had a good time 'cause of "that kinda thing!"

00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:24.520
You got me again, Ayukawa...

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:28.160
I'm through with this look!

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:28.750
Oh?
I'm through with this look!

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:28.830
I'm through with this look!

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:32.900
'Cause, even if you like me
wearing a grown-up outfit...

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:35.490
...I don't think it's really me that you like!

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:38.690
Hikaru...

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:43.160
Besides, it's exhausting to dress up like a grown-up!

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:47.050
It's so like you to say that!

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:52.120
Seeing Hikaru like that... made me think once again just how adorable she is...

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:54.150
And besides...

00:22:57.120 --> 00:23:00.260
I'm sorry for making you help me out 'til closing.

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:01.320
Huh...?

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:07.970
No one's ever told me I'm cute, you know...

00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:08.570
Huh?

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:12.180
So... should I take it off? It's not me, is it?

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:14.840
Umm... It's...

00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:16.530
...very cute.

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:31.890
I, Kasuga Kyosuke...

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:38.150
...thought that girls' emotions are exceedingly complicated.

00:23:54.780 --> 00:24:02.390
I dream of casting a spell
that captures your heart...

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:09.960
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:25.310
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.310 --> 00:24:37.930
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:37.930 --> 00:24:48.140
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.140 --> 00:24:55.140
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.140 --> 00:25:06.550
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.550 --> 00:25:14.660
I had a foreboding dream on the morning of Tanabata (July 7th).

00:25:14.660 --> 00:25:18.730
Ayukawa leaves, saying,
"A cowardly man like you is the worst!"

00:25:18.730 --> 00:25:21.900
Oh! There's no way I can let
such a thing become a reality!

00:25:21.900 --> 00:25:25.910
But then... the fact is that
I got dusted by a girl easily.

00:25:25.910 --> 00:25:30.170
Next time: "A Foreboding Dream!
Madoka and Kyosuke Breaking Up At Last!"
